### 用 VS Code 的 REST Client 插件直接点“Send Request”；也可以照着在 Postman/Apifox 里建接口用例
### 先启动后端（IDEA 或 docker compose），再把下面的 token 换成登录返回的那串

@host = http://localhost:3200
@token = 在这里粘贴登录返回的token

### 1. 健康检查（监控/负载均衡探活用）
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### 2. 注册新用户
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "smoke_user",
  "password": "123456",
  "email": "smoke@example.com"
}

### 3. 登录（返回的 data 就是 token）
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "smoke_user",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 4. 酒店列表（真实高德数据）
GET {{host}}/travel/hotels?city=上海&keyword=酒店
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 酒店多图（详情页相册）
GET {{host}}/travel/photos?name=上海外滩豫园美居酒店&city=上海
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 下单（带幂等键：同一个 key 重复发只会生成一张订单）
POST {{host}}/order/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: smoke-order-001

{
  "type": "HOTEL",
  "fromCity": "上海外滩豫园美居酒店",
  "toCity": "上海",
  "travelDate": "2026-10-01",
  "departTime": "2026-10-02",
  "arriveTime": "",
  "seat": "标准大床房 × 1晚",
  "price": 1471,
  "passenger": "smoke_user",
  "phone": "13800000000"
}

### 7. 再发一次（orderNo 应该和上面完全一样 = 幂等生效）
POST {{host}}/order/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: smoke-order-001

{
  "type": "HOTEL",
  "fromCity": "上海外滩豫园美居酒店",
  "toCity": "上海",
  "travelDate": "2026-10-01",
  "departTime": "2026-10-02",
  "arriveTime": "",
  "seat": "标准大床房 × 1晚",
  "price": 1471,
  "passenger": "smoke_user",
  "phone": "13800000000"
}

### 8. 我的订单
GET {{host}}/order/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 支付订单（把 1 换成上一步返回的订单 id）
POST {{host}}/order/pay/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "method": "ALIPAY"
}

### 10. 申请退订（已支付订单需要管理员审批，通过后自动退款）
POST {{host}}/order/cancel/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. 修改密码（成功后当前 token 失效，需要重新登录）
POST {{host}}/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "oldPassword": "123456",
  "newPassword": "1234567"
}

### 12. 退出登录（token 进黑名单，再拿它访问会被 401）
POST {{host}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. 管理员登录（默认 admin / admin123，上线记得改）
POST {{host}}/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 14. 管理后台数据统计
GET {{host}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. 待处理申请（改签/退订审批列表）
GET {{host}}/admin/order-changes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. 管理员维护库存（把 1 号酒店 2026-10-01 的标准大床房库存设成 5）
POST {{host}}/admin/stocks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "placeId": 1,
  "bizDate": "2026-10-01",
  "roomType": "标准大床房",
  "total": 5,
  "price": 428
}

### 17. 查看某天各房型剩余库存
GET {{host}}/travel/stock?placeId=1&date=2026-10-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 18. 查看某个地点的全部库存配置
GET {{host}}/admin/stocks?placeId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
